"settings_whisper_more": "Whisper is a speech recognition model by OpenAI. Groq offers it free within a daily limit, OpenAI for about 0.006 USD per minute of recording (as of Nov 2026). Works on Android 13 and newer. The recording stays in the phone’s memory only, never on disk. When Whisper fails, the phone’s text stays and the window after the recording says why.",
